# Resource-type coverage
library "Resource Coverage".

/*
Exercises base-QI-Core case-feature emit across three resource types. Each concept is a local
`code is` existence determination (charter §4: a valueless record's existence IS the determination;
the boolean is the ephemeral CQL reading). Used by the CEL-emit resource-coverage test to prove
Observation/Procedure/MedicationRequest instances emit with their QI-Core required elements +
`meta.profile`.
*/

concept "Screening Assessment":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `screening-assessment`.
- definition is exists this.

concept "Stimulator Procedure":
- type is Procedure.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `stimulator-procedure`.
- definition is exists this.

concept "Requested Medication":
- type is MedicationRequest.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `requested-medication`.
- definition is exists this.

decision "Resource Coverage":
first:
- when "Screening Assessment" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".

activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Approved.`.

activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied.`.
